=== what this does to our efficiency claims ===
  every archived saving on this branch (Eterna 1.54x, nested 25x) divides by the cost of
  DesiRNA at ONE budget. On this curve the same capability is available at:
    -t    5s ->  72/100 at $0.0021/target   (86% of the -t 180s capability at 0.079x the price)
    -t   15s ->  77/100 at $0.0034/target   (92% of the -t 180s capability at 0.128x the price)
    -t   60s ->  81/100 at $0.0099/target   (96% of the -t 180s capability at 0.369x the price)
    -t  180s ->  84/100 at $0.0267/target   (100% of the -t 180s capability at 1.000x the price)

